1
00:00:05,713 --> 00:00:08,713
(Howard:)Thanks for helping us sort
through all my mom's stuff.

2
00:00:08,717 --> 00:00:10,347
(Raj:)Of course.

3
00:00:10,352 --> 00:00:11,682
(Raj:)I know what it's like

4
00:00:11,686 --> 00:00:14,316
(Raj:)having to go through
a loved one's possessions.

5
00:00:14,322 --> 00:00:16,952
(Raj:)My uncle was
a worshipper of Krishna.

6
00:00:16,958 --> 00:00:19,528
(Raj:)But after he died,
you know what we found?

7
00:00:19,528 --> 00:00:22,598
(Raj:)A statue of Shiva.

8
00:00:25,099 --> 00:00:26,729
(Raj:)It may not be
Crips and Bloods, okay?

9
00:00:26,735 --> 00:00:28,865
(Raj:)But in India, it's a thing.

10
00:00:30,571 --> 00:00:32,341
(Bernadette:)Well, it'll be good
that you're there.

11
00:00:32,340 --> 00:00:33,610
(Bernadette:)Howard's been having
trouble deciding

12
00:00:33,608 --> 00:00:35,508
(Bernadette:)what to keep
and what to let go.

13
00:00:35,510 --> 00:00:37,080
(Howard:)Well, it's hard.

14
00:00:37,078 --> 00:00:40,348
(Howard:)A lot of Ma's stuff
brings back fond memories.

15
00:00:40,348 --> 00:00:41,778
(Bernadette:)Is that why you couldn't
get rid of

16
00:00:41,783 --> 00:00:44,583
(Bernadette:)her drawer
full of ketchup packets?

17
00:00:44,586 --> 00:00:47,816
(Howard:)Yes. It reminds me of us
eating out and her saying,

18
00:00:47,822 --> 00:00:50,622
"Quick, nobody's looking,
fill your pockets with ketchup."

19
